<title>CHILE: Chile May fishmeal exports fall sharply.</title>
<headline>Chile May fishmeal exports fall sharply.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean fishmeal exports fell to $43.1 million in May from $64.9 million in the same month last year, said the Central Bank in its monthly report.</p>
<p>The report did not give any reason for the drop.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
